<div class="container">
  <h1 class="page-title">📌 Pinned</h1>
  <p class="post-description" style="font-size:1.15rem;max-width:46ch;">Save the places you love. Drop a pin, scan a storefront, or save from a shared link — then find your way back when you're ready.</p>

  <p style="margin:1.5rem 0;">
    <em>Coming soon to the App Store.</em>
  </p>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>What it's for</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>I'm standing in front of something I want to save.</strong> Drop a pin or scan the sign with your camera.</li>
      <li><strong>I heard about a place and want to find it fast.</strong> Search, or save it straight from a shared link.</li>
      <li><strong>What should I explore around me right now?</strong> See what's nearby on the map.</li>
      <li><strong>Help me remember, revisit, and navigate.</strong> Notes, visits, and one-tap directions.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Features</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Collections</strong> — group places into lists, with smart rules that file new pins automatically</li>
      <li><strong>Tags &amp; filters</strong> — narrow the map to just what you're looking for</li>
      <li><strong>Scan to save</strong> — point your camera at a storefront or sign to identify a place</li>
      <li><strong>Save from anywhere</strong> — a share extension pulls places in from Maps links and the web</li>
      <li><strong>Private by design</strong> — your data lives on your devices and syncs through your own iCloud. No servers, no analytics, no tracking.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>Pinned collects nothing. Everything you save stays on your device and syncs privately through your personal iCloud account. Read the full <a href="/pinned/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <p class="post-meta">Built with SwiftUI, SwiftData, MapKit, and CloudKit · by <a href="/about/">Dominic Critchlow</a></p>
  </section>
</div>
